    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d42">

                <pb facs="0080" n="26" sameAs="frus:frus1944Quebec/pg26"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to Prime Minister
                        Churchill</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d42-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-08-31">31 August 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Number 612, personal and top secret, from the President for the Prime
                    Minister.</p>
                <p>Your 773.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d42-f2"/> I am distressed at the news of your
                    illness. Please guard your health first and above all other considerations.</p>
                <p>We can postpone <hi rendition="#small-caps">Octagon</hi> to some later date if it
                    appears advisable to do so.</p>
                <p>Where is landing spot? If New York you and I could go to <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Octagon</hi> together on my train.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d42-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d42-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attaché, London, via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d42-f2" n="2" xml:id="d42-f2-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
